  unitName: Occult Arms Malbelle
  unitId: 60895
  unitNumber: 1252
  description: When the souls of two dead gods were summoned from another world,
    she used that opportunity to descend to Elgaia herself. There she began her search
    for new technologies immediately, and discovered many. Among them was Summoning,
    a technique created by the gods of that world, which she found particularly inspiring.
    However, as she went about her search, she encountered three Summoners. She fled
    immediately, sensing that these were powerful beings, but soon encountered another
    goddess from her home world.
  summonDesc: Human-loving and hating goddesses...<br>What does each destroy, or
    save?<br>In the end, there is always ruin.
  fusionDesc: Summoning makes humans<br>even more foolish...<br>Those Summoners were
    cursed beings,<br>even more so than others...
  evoDesc: Elgaia...<br>The system is false here, too.<br>I shall evolve, if I can...
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
